sequenceDiagram
  participant M as MacGuard
  participant T as trust.json (0600)
  participant V as ChannelVerifier
  M->>T: load newest verified checkpoint (size, root)
  M->>V: verify the new release
  V->>V: compare size and root with the trusted ones
  alt smaller, or another root at the same size
    V-->>M: rollback or fork
    M->>M: refuse, do not replace the rules
  else larger
    V->>V: consistency proof from the trusted checkpoint
    V-->>M: ok, save the new checkpoint
  end
